B.O3=new A.jF("Mental Health Test","A web-based self-assessment tool for checking in on emotional well-being.","A simple, easy-to-use web app that guides people through a short questionnaire so they can reflect on how they are feeling.","The focus was clear UX and solid form validation, so a sensitive flow stays easy to complete.",B.J8,B.oA,B.ca,"https://apuloo.github.io/Mental_health_test/",null,null,"Key Takeaway",!1)
