B.NZ=new A.jF("Tagalog Learning App","Interactive games that make learning Tagalog fun.","Made for a friend in the US who wanted a playful way to learn Filipino, using game-style lessons.","It gave me hands-on practice with gamification, localization, and responsive web design.",B.JU,B.oA,B.ca,"https://nbgnapulo.github.io/tagalogapp/",null,null,"Key Takeaway",!1)
