B.O1=new A.jF("License Plate Detection","Reads and classifies license plates using OCR and color analysis.","An exploration of computer vision that detects license plates in images and reads them in near real time.","It showed me how image processing can support traffic monitoring and security use cases.",B.Jy,B.IA,B.I_,null,null,null,"Key Takeaway",!1)
