B.O2=new A.jF("Forecasting Carbon Emissions in Manufacturing Using Deep Learning","Thesis project: a hybrid deep learning and time series framework that forecasts carbon emissions in real-world manufacturing.","Thesis for the B.S. in Computer Science at Map\xfaa Malayan Colleges Laguna. The project combines deep learning with time series methods to forecast carbon emissions, using historical production and environmental data from a food manufacturing company. The model captures complex, non-linear emission patterns while preserving chronological dependencies.","Identified the main drivers of carbon output across production processes, built a decision-support tool for reducing emissions and optimizing production schedules, and showed that AI can be a scalable approach to environmental management.",B.IH,B.Js,B.ca,null,"Aug 2024 \u2013 May 2026","Co-authors: Jeffrey L. Cuevas and Marvin Christianelle C. Nievera. Adviser: Jonalyn G. Ebron.","Key Contributions",!1)
